sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Post (text + metadata)
    participant M1 as Classifier A<br/>Claude Sonnet 4.6
    participant M2 as Classifier B<br/>GPT-5 or Opus 4.7
    participant ARB as Field-wise comparator
    participant H as Human reviewer pool<br/>(2 annotators)
    participant DS as Structured dataset

    P->>M1: prompt + JSON Schema
    P->>M2: prompt + JSON Schema
    M1-->>ARB: record_A (5 fields)
    M2-->>ARB: record_B (5 fields)
    ARB->>ARB: compare per field
    alt all 5 fields agree
        ARB->>DS: accept record_A
    else any field disagrees
        ARB->>H: enqueue post + both records<br/>highlight disputed fields
        H->>H: annotator 1 + annotator 2<br/>independent label
        alt annotators agree
            H->>DS: accept human label
        else annotators disagree
            H->>H: adjudication (third reader)
            H->>DS: accept adjudicated label
        end
    end
    Note over ARB,H: Track per-field disagreement<br/>rate as a quality signal
